    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "在时刻 t=5 sec 时施加正幅值推力脉冲激励系统，随后在时刻 t=6.1 sec 时施加具有相同幅值和持续时间的负脉冲。在实际工程中，卫星姿态角正是通过这种方式进行控制的。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "Excite the system with a positive-magnitude thrust pulse at time t=5 sec, then follow with a negative pulse with the same magnitude and duration at time t=6.1 sec. This is how the satellite attitude angle is controlled in practice.",
